    "description": "Go inside the casting process for a rare, practical look at how performances are evaluated - and how the right adjustment can completely transform a self-tape. Using real prepared self-tapes, casting agents Monika Dalman, Errin Lally, and Annalese Tilling will break down what they notice, what works, what gets in the way and how they approach giving redirects. Audiences will then see actors respond to those notes in revised performances, creating a before-and-after look at the casting process. Essential for actors, directors, and genre filmmakers.",
